  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• Thinly slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Roughly chop capsicum and brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Finely chop or crush garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459776e4158183d5e3b31/step-91bec000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook capsicum, zucchini and onion until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add cannellini beans, 1/2 the garlic and chermoula spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459776e4158183d5e3b31/step-0a35a410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in passata, the water, stock powder and brown sugar until combined. Simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove saucepan from heat and stir through 1/2 the butter until melted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459776e4158183d5e3b31/step-99e4ca20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While stew is simmering, cut continental rolls into slices. Toast or grill rolls to your liking.\n• In a small heatproof bowl, microwave the remaining garlic and the remaining butter in 10 second bursts, until melted and fragrant.\n• Spread garlic butter over toasted rolls. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Divide one-pot Moroccan white bean stew between bowls. Crumble over fetta cubes (see ingredients). Serve with garlic dippers.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459776e4158183d5e3b31/step-a04d1b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
